@page "/"

<PageTitle>InventoryHub - Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Welcome to InventoryHub</h1>

<p>
    InventoryHub is a full-stack .NET 8 application integrating a <strong>Blazor WebAssembly</strong> front-end
    with an <strong>ASP.NET Core Minimal API</strong> back-end.
</p>

<div class="info-card">
    <h3>Key Features</h3>
    <ul>
        <li>Structured JSON API responses with nested <code>Category</code> metadata</li>
        <li>CORS-enabled Minimal API communication with resilient error handling</li>
        <li>Server-side <code>IMemoryCache</code> + Gzip response compression</li>
        <li>Client-side in-memory caching and request cancellation</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="btn-primary" href="fetchproducts">View Product Inventory</a>
</div>
